{"id":"servant-leader","name":"Servant Leader","type":"Scout Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b72a373f02f42d4712f3607724b9c13f.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/1107446438.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Assault Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/953cfdeb2703978b1ab449b991b98989.png","desc":"This shotgun's magazine is optimized for quick combat.\n  •  Greatly increases stability\n  •  Increases rate of fire"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."},{"name":"Tunnel Vision","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ab0837be56c8d5cfc474acd4f3f9c7ac.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating a target greatly increases target acquisition and aim down sight speed for a short duration."},{"name":"Heating Up","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/39d2032b3c5bc7a5b2fe391c64ccb7db.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase accuracy and stability while improving vertical recoil."},{"name":"Shoot to Loot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e8c6e23afe3c4215f0dc0c2941500c28.png","desc":"Shooting an Orb of Power picks it up. Shooting an ammo brick picks it up and automatically reloads all of your equipped weapons from reserves."},{"name":"Pulse Monitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/64642b7455e88ffde77be53ce7cb7c05.png","desc":"Automatically reloads the magazine and improves weapon handling when wounded—even when this weapon is stowed."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"No Distractions","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3f6534e7fd934e0ecfeb1cac9da9c97f.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon for a short period reduces flinch."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Outlaw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/382df469a091c33e190ee583b64923e8.png","desc":"Precision kills greatly decrease reload time."},{"name":"Rapid Hit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/de22847fa94634a487758041887bcdaa.png","desc":"Rapid precision hits temporarily increase stability and reload speed."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Thresh","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7f9dcf3bd4a8a4e0d2d0922827f038c9.png","desc":"Killing combatants with this weapon generates a small amount of Super energy."},{"name":"Osmosis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ca6e872824561b12e91517e1bde608.png","desc":"Using your grenade ability partially refills the magazine and changes this weapon's damage type to match your grenade until you stow it."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Adrenaline Junkie","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6f8bde03140b53e6dc583ada1aeaa51d.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage and handling from final blows with grenades or this weapon."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Multikill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3749921a74a378259228d5e989459311.png","desc":"Reloading grants increased damage based on the number of rapid final blows made beforehand."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1